\ One manifest for the whole migrating test suite (P8.S2 R7). Every file-based
\ fixture depends on the same two things -- `core` and the compiler-provided
\ `intrinsics` -- so a manifest per test grouping would be near-identical
\ copies that drift. Passed on the command line (`--manifest`) rather than
\ discovered, which is what keeps a fixture written to a temp directory
\ reproducible: the path is named at the call site, never inherited from a
\ developer's machine.
package: fixtures ;
layer: hosted ;
depends: core path "../../lib/core" ;
depends: hosted path "../../lib/hosted" ;
